- **en**: English.', example='zh'),
  name?: string(name='Name', description='The name of the vulnerability to query.', example='debian:10:CVE-2019-9893'),
  namespace?: string(name='Namespace', description='The namespace.', example='test-002'),
  necessity?: string(name='Necessity', description='The priority level of vulnerability fixing. Valid values:
- **asap**: high-priority vulnerability
- **later**: medium-priority vulnerability
- **nntf**: low-priority vulnerability.', example='asap'),
  pageSize?: int32(name='PageSize', description='Settings for the number of vulnerabilities to display on each page in a paged query. Default value: **10**, which indicates that 10 vulnerabilities are displayed on each page.', example='10'),
  pod?: string(name='Pod', description='The pod.', example='22222-7xsqq'),
  regionId?: string(name='RegionId', description='The region ID of the instance.', example='cn-hangzhou'),
  repoId?: string(name='RepoId', description='The ID of the container image repository.', example='qew****'),
  repoInstanceId?: string(name='RepoInstanceId', description='The instance ID of the container image repository.', example='i-qewqrqcsadf****'),
  repoName?: string(name='RepoName', description='The name of the container image repository.', example='libssh2'),
  repoNamespace?: string(name='RepoNamespace', description='The namespace of the container image repository.', example='libssh2'),
  repoRegionId?: string(name='RepoRegionId', description='The region ID of the container image repository.', example='cn-hangzhou'),
